<BaseLayout title="ChatGPT vs TotalRecalls" description="ChatGPT official export vs. TotalRecalls.">
  <h1>ChatGPT vs. TotalRecalls</h1>
  <p>OpenAI's built-in export gives you a JSON dump of your conversations. TotalRecalls gives you a <strong>searchable, tagged, Markdown library</strong> with full metadata.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Official export:</strong> ZIP file with conversations.json — no search, no structure.</li>
    <li><strong>TotalRecalls:</strong> Markdown + JSON, organized folders, timestamps, model names, and full-text search.</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
